``csharp public const string sp_BuscarOperacionesInsertarSWFOUTPKDB = "sp_BuscarOperacionesInsertarSWFOUTPKDB"; ` while the only definition in StoredProcedures (all three .sql trees were searched) is CREATE PROCEDURE dbo.usp_BuscarOperacionesInsertarSWFOUTPKDB. The other four constants in the same file hold usp_`-form values, and the three procedures this service actually calls resolve in the SQL project.
