• Recommended code:
``csharp public const string usp_BuscarOperacionesInsertarSWFOUTPKDB = "usp_BuscarOperacionesInsertarSWFOUTPKDB"; ` Confirm with the DBA which name exists in each environment (SELECT name FROM sys.procedures WHERE name LIKE '%BuscarOperacionesInsertarSWFOUTPKDB'), keep exactly one, and add a pipeline check that every usp_* constant has a matching CREATE PROCEDURE (see GEN-13`) plus a smoke test that executes each procedure the service calls.
• Benefit: removes a silent total-outage risk on the one path this service exists for, and aligns the code, SQL project, and database.
• Suggested JIRA: PKDB-1 (Blocker)
